#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:386
msgid "Other Language Changes"
msgstr "Ostatní změny jazyka"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:388
msgid ""
"A :keyword:`continue` statement was illegal in the :keyword:`finally` clause"
" due to a problem with the implementation.  In Python 3.8 this restriction "
"was lifted. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`32489`.)"
msgstr ""
"Klíčové slovo :keyword:`continue` bylo nelegelní v klauzuli "
":keyword:`finally` kvůli problému s implementací. V Pythonu 3.8 bylo toto "
"omezení zrušeno. (Přispěla Serhiy Storchaka v :issue:`32489`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:393
msgid ""
"The :class:`bool`, :class:`int`, and :class:`fractions.Fraction` types now "
"have an :meth:`~int.as_integer_ratio` method like that found in "
":class:`float` and :class:`decimal.Decimal`.  This minor API extension makes"
" it possible to write ``numerator, denominator = x.as_integer_ratio()`` and "
"have it work across multiple numeric types. (Contributed by Lisa Roach in "
":issue:`33073` and Raymond Hettinger in :issue:`37819`.)"
msgstr ""
"Typy :class:`bool`, :class:`int` a :class:`fractions.Fraction` májí nyní "
"metodu :meth:`~int.as_integer_ratio` jako ta, kterou najdete v "
":class:`float` a :class:`decimal.Decimal`. Toto malé rozšíření API umožňuje "
"napsat ``numerator, denominator = x.as_integer_ratio()`` a mít to fungovat v"
" rámci víc numérických typů. (Přispěla Lisa Roach v :issue:`33073` a Raymond"
" Hettinger v :issue:`37819`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:401
msgid ""
"Constructors of :class:`int`, :class:`float` and :class:`complex` will now "
"use the :meth:`~object.__index__` special method, if available and the "
"corresponding method :meth:`~object.__int__`, :meth:`~object.__float__` or "
":meth:`~object.__complex__` is not available. (Contributed by Serhiy "
"Storchaka in :issue:`20092`.)"
msgstr ""
"Konstruktory :class:`int`, :class:`float` a :class:`complex` budou nyní "
"používat speciální metodu :meth:`~object.__index__`, pokud je dostupná a "
"odpovídaící metoda :meth:`~object.__int__`, :meth:`~object.__float__` nebo "
":meth:`~object.__complex__` není dostupná. (Přispěla Serhiy Storchaka v "
":issue:`20092`.)"

