#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:1033
msgid ""
"On Windows, much of the manual logic for handling reparse points (including "
"symlinks and directory junctions) has been delegated to the operating "
"system. Specifically, :func:`os.stat` will now traverse anything supported "
"by the operating system, while :func:`os.lstat` will only open reparse "
"points that identify as \"name surrogates\" while others are opened as for "
":func:`os.stat`. In all cases, :attr:`os.stat_result.st_mode` will only have"
" ``S_IFLNK`` set for symbolic links and not other kinds of reparse points. "
"To identify other kinds of reparse point, check the new "
":attr:`os.stat_result.st_reparse_tag` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Na Windowsu byla vetsi casti manualni logiky pro manipulaci reparse body "
"(vcetne symlinku a adresaroveho spojeni) delegovana operacnimu systemu. "
"Konkretne :func:`os.stat` nyn projde cokoliv podporovane operacnim systemem,"
" zatimco :func:`os.lstat` otevra pouze reparse body, ktere se identifikuji "
"jako \"name surrogates\" zatimco ostatni jsou otevreny jako pro "
":func:`os.stat`. Ve vsech pripadech bude :attr:`os.stat_result.st_mode` mit "
"nastaven pouze ``S_IFLNK`` pro symbolicke odkazy a ne pro ostatni druhy "
"reparse body. Chcete-li identifikovat ostatni druhy reparse body, "
"zkontrolujte novy atribut :attr:`os.stat_result.st_reparse_tag`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:1042
msgid ""
"On Windows, :func:`os.readlink` is now able to read directory junctions. "
"Note that :func:`~os.path.islink` will return ``False`` for directory "
"junctions, and so code that checks ``islink`` first will continue to treat "
"junctions as directories, while code that handles errors from "
":func:`os.readlink` may now treat junctions as links."
msgstr ""
"Na Windowsu je :func:`os.readlink` nyn schopna cist adresarova spojeni. "
"Poznamejte, ze :func:`~os.path.islink` vraci ``False`` pro adresarova "
"spojeni a kód, ktery prvne kontroluje ``islink`` bude pokracovat v "
"zpracovani junctiony jako adresaru, zatimco kód, ktery zpracovava chyby z "
":func:`os.readlink` muze nyn zpracovavat junctiony jako linky."

