":meth:`~ast.NodeVisitor.visit_Constant` ke zpracovani vsech uzlu konstant. "
"(Prispela Serhiy Storchaka v :issue:`36917`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:1680
msgid ""
"The :deco:`!asyncio.coroutine` :term:`decorator` is deprecated and will be "
