msgstr ""
"Funkce :func:`!bind_textdomain_codeset`, metody "
":meth:`!NullTranslations.output_charset` a "
":meth:`!NullTranslations.set_output_charset` a parametr *codeset* funkcich "
":func:`~gettext.translation` a :func:`~gettext.install` jsou rovnez "
"zastaraly, jelikoz jsou pouzivany pouze pro funkce ``l*gettext()``. "
"(Prispela Serhiy Storchaka v :issue:`33710`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.8.rst:1715
msgid ""
"The :meth:`!isAlive` method of :class:`threading.Thread` has been "
